{
  "slug": "memoriant-eval-sandbox-skill",
  "name": "Memoriant Eval Sandbox Skill",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI agent evaluation sandbox for Claude Code. Holdout scenario testing with Doer/Judge/Adversary/Observer roles, probabilistic satisfaction scoring, and append-only JSONL audit trails with integrity hashes. Test your agents before deploying them. Includes full Python evaluation framework.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `eval-sandbox` (Design and run structured AI agent evaluations) and **1 agent**, `eval-sandbox-runner`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install memoriant-eval-sandbox-skill@claude-community` from `NathanMaine/memoriant-eval-sandbox-skill`.\n\nA Claude Code plugin for structured AI agent evaluation. Define scenarios with Doer/Judge/Adversary/Observer roles, run multi-step simulations, score behavior probabilistically, and generate machine-readable audit evidence for compliance and regression testing.",
